/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * EXERCISE NAMING RULES
 * Format:  [Main Variant] [Domain] | [Other modifier] [(equipment/surface)]
 *
 *   • Domain        — the movement family: Push-Up, Planche, Planche Push-Up, …
 *   • Main Variant  — qualifiers like "Tuck", "Straddle"; always BEFORE domain.
 *   • Other modifier— only added when an exercise has TWO modifiers; goes
 *                     AFTER the "|".
 *   • (equipment)   — always AFTER the "|" and in brackets.
 *
 * DIFFICULTY ANCHORS (floor push-up family):
 *   Push-Up (standard)             → 3.0
 *   Pseudo Planche Push-Up         → 4.5
 *   Tuck Planche Push-Up           → 7.5
 *   Advanced Tuck Planche Push-Up  → 8.3
 *   Straddle Planche Push-Up       → 9.5
 *   Full Planche Push-Up           → 10.0
 *
 * ADDING AN EXERCISE — log it here: ID · NAME · DIFF. IDs must be unique
 * across the whole project; the 550–649 block is reserved for this file.
 *
 *  550  Wall Push-Up | Pseudo Planche          1.3  (moved from pushup-wall)
 *  33   Knee Push-Up | Pseudo Planche          2.8  (moved from pushup-knee)
 *  101  Incline Push-Up | Knee, Pseudo Planche 1.5  (moved from pushup-incline)
 *  428  Incline Push-Up | Pseudo Planche       1.8  (moved from pushup-incline)
 *  115  Decline Push-Up | Knee, Pseudo Planche 5.5  (moved 